# The ending's carpet ride past screen 12 (PlayerEndingRideOn, $81:E315), which the ride (PlayerEndingRide) falls into when the scroll
# reaches screen 12, about 14000 frames into the ending and 2000 frames of a scroll later than the ending's scenes go on to need it.
# cov_ending's play (stage_a0_s0) to frame 10600, when the ride is in its bobbing stretch: his resume address ($08DE) is poked to $E315,
# the place the ride falls into, and the play goes on: its first wait ($149 frames); the scroll's screen ($1774, the play field's x
# screen) poked to $17, as the scroll sets it, ends the second; $1BA frames; the view's row ($1778) poked to 2 for a frame, then the screen
# to $1E; and his flight on until he is past the view.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a0_s0.state
wait 10600
poke 0008DE 15,E3
wait 400
poke 001774 17
wait 480
poke 001778 02
wait 1
poke 001778 00
poke 001774 1E
wait 900
